e1f0-54a1-9012-9009b953e642" :question/math-academy-id "q-128014" :question/problem "What is the minor of ${a}_{12}$ in the matrix\n$A=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -3d & 5b \\\\ b & {c}^{2} & b-d \\\\ b & -10c & b+d\\end{aligned}]?$" :question/worked-solution "First, we remove the first row and second column:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & -3d & ∗ \\\\ b & ∗ & b-d \\\\ b & ∗ & b+d\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det[\\begin{aligned}b & b-d \\\\ b & b+d\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}b & b-d \\\\ b & b+d\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =b\\cdot (b+d)-(b-d)\\cdot b \\\\  & ={b}^{2}+bd-{b}^{2}+db \\\\  & =2bd\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-128014/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1ff88785-9281-5431-86d8-95fd89866787"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-128014"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-128083/selection/5a9ab66cf0914dc7206087cbf2a450898b373ad9b65911384a54053090b3dc41" :answer/id #uuid "e31ad534-255a-581f-b428-c4ea95f4f32f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "p=7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128083/selection/2b8ca121b15f5b037be627c02b54909a312836f80aaa621d694df3df92095ab2" :answer/id #uuid "78d179ae-6396-5e52-ab4a-5936d9daae48" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "p=9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128083/selection/b6680d8f21bf77fc06134c6919b1987ade3bd9bbdf4c6109d44e33d7c9e70ceb" :answer/id #uuid "e4c77a2e-d0fb-52e7-b262-d681cd277a1a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "p=-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128083/selection/9a2d766882a396270eb67f0d2505a2347bd2f65aaf4ddccddd2d70d6066a5036" :answer/id #uuid "ce65fab5-d38e-5404-af83-394e52f8f80a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "p=-\\frac{5}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128083/selection/a426a0788f8ced243f1a345d97159dc8ec2211f417d84b9d62961a44f8f22589" :answer/id 