03ad126484d0fbc6f9f71f7a4243e2b12ac9ab8548aea8d1ffd87dc"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-128087" :question/id #uuid "973be3ee-3185-59a3-97f5-2ef9e1fa56de" :question/math-academy-id "q-128087" :question/problem "Given that the minor of ${m}_{21}$ is $11$, find all the possible values of $y$ in the matrix\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}y & \\frac{3}{2} & y \\\\ 25 & 4-y & 12y \\\\ y & 2 & -6y\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we remove the second row and first column:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & \\frac{3}{2} & y \\\\ 25 & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & 2 & -6y\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe minor of ${m}_{21}$ is\n\n \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{2} & y \\\\ 2 & -6y\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{2} & y \\\\ 2 & -6y\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot (-6y)-y\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-11y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're told that the minor of ${m}_{21}$ is $11$, so we must have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-11y & =11 \\\\ y & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $y=-1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-128087/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4aa65a73-e750-5052-9249-7c096297ae51"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-128087"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-275530/field-1/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "fcec5bf5-c244-5346-a821-261d6fd2baa0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275530/field-1/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "9d382f75-3cf3-500a-a4bd-ca561f8516bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275530/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "562568b5-fbbd-5a72-b8c7-51736263fa19" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275530/field-1/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer-field/choices ["q-275530/field-1/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" "q-275530/field-1/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275530/field-2/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "db4b9131-5fa9-552a-ba5b-692e5cfc1451" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275530/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "42c56cc1-6826-5ee1-9aee-341d32eb0613" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275530/field-2/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-275530/field-2/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275530" :question/id #uuid "11118463-734f-544a-8796-95bbe47cd463" :question/math-academy-id "q-275530" :question/problem "Given that the minor of ${a}_{11}$ is $17$, find all the possible values of $p$ in the matrix\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & p & 4 \\\\ 6 & -2 & p\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIn **ascending order**, the values of $p$ are\n\n$p=$ \n{{field-1}} $\\,$ and $\\,p=$\n{{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "To evaluate the minor of ${a}_{11},$ we remove the first row and first column:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}5 & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & p & 4 \\\\ ∗ & -2 & p\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of ${a}_{11}$ is\n\n \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}p & 4 \\\\ -2 & p\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}p & 4 \\\\ -2 & p\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =p\\cdot p-4\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & ={p}^{2}+8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're told that the minor of ${a}_{11}$ is $17$, so we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{p}^{2}+8 & =17 \\\\ {p}^{2}-9 & =0 \\\\ (p-3)(p+3) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, in ascending order, the solutions are $p=-3$ and $p=3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-275530/field-1" "q-275530/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4aa65a73-e750-5052-9249-7c096297ae51"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-275530"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-319175/field-1/502522aab6c56e55f6ca652d6d94ee7025b9f51a12026d8c952cd235ea02f320" :answer/id #uuid "02bf0b23-2529-5e40-bfc6-f5ebd72b819b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2e-3df" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-319175/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "8c81744c-9b37-549e-a8fa-a0e75125981a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-319175/field-1/502522aab6c56e55f6ca652d6d94ee7025b9f51a12026d8c952cd235ea02f320" :answer-field/choices ["q-319175/field-1/502522aab6c56e55f6ca652d6d94ee7025b9f51a12026d8c952cd235ea02f320"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-319175" :question/id #uuid "b130fa55-3f50-510b-926c-663e12654696" :question/math-academy-id "q-319175" :question/problem "For the matrix\n$T=[\\begin{aligned}1 & e & f \\\\ 5 & 3d & 2 \\\\ 4 & 7 & d\\end{aligned}],$\nfind the minor ${M}_{31}$ of the element ${t}_{31}.$\n\n${M}_{31}=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "To evaluate the minor of ${t}_{31},$ we remove the third row and first column:\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & e & f \\\\ ∗ & 3d & 2 \\\\ 4 & ∗ & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of ${t}_{31}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{31} & =det[\\begin{aligned}e & f \\\\ 3d & 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}e & f \\\\ 3d & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =e\\cdot 2-f\\cdot (3d) \\\\  & =2e-3df.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-319175/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1ff88785-9281-5431-86d8-95fd89866787"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-319175"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
